# Nar Shaddaa, Vogga's droid warehouse and away to Goto's yacht (TSL,
# 303NAR, 301NAR, 351NAR): played as T3-M4, C6-E3's complaint, C7-E3's
# assignment, C6-E3's offer and C7-E3 tricked into his own deactivation,
# the inner warehouse opened, the door's rotation puzzle (center and left
# counter-clockwise, right clockwise), B-4R5's transponder codes and blank
# card, the three HK-50s fought, T3 out; Atton, Mira joining, Tienn Tubb
# changing the Ebon Hawk's ID signature to one of Vogga's freighters, Mira
# and T3-M4 sent aboard (DSimpson: Mira for the mines, T3 for the
# computers), and the Hawk taken by Goto's yacht: Goto's talk with the
# Exile.
# Starts from T3-M4's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @nar_shaddaa_t3 data/routes/tsl/nar_shaddaa_warehouse.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Vogga's Warehouse" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
use C6E3
talk
say [Persuade] Dwoooooo
say Dwoooooo.
use C7E3             # assigned to C6-E3
talk
use C6E3             # his offer
talk
use C7E3             # deactivated
talk
fight 20
talk                 # C6-E3 opens the inner warehouse
say Rotate center block counter-clockwise.
say Rotate left-most block counter-clockwise.
say Rotate right-most block clockwise.
use Door_Controls
talk
use B4R5             # the codes and the blank card
talk
to tr_hk50attack     # the HK-50s
talk
fight 30
to tr_t3m4exit
talk                 # Mira joins; Tienn Tubb
say Mira.            # sent aboard
say T3-M4.
talk
module 351nar        # Goto's yacht
talk
save nar_shaddaa_yacht
